            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Injury to the peroneal tendons is a frequently overlooked cause of persistent lateral ankle pain after trauma. Peroneal tendon anatomy, biomechanics, diagnostic studies, and traumatic disorders were reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
